Variable Energy_Use_per_CLFT
Title: Energy Use per Customer over lifetime
Units: kWh
Description: The lifetime energy use per customer per year per product for products sold that year.~
Also known as "energy consumption per lifetime" sold in that year.
Definition: SUM(Annual_Energy_Use_pe * System_Lifetime, System)
