Variable Energy_Use_of_total_
Att_PrevIndexValue: ['','','','','','']
Title: Energy Use % of total per Customer
Description: Total energy use % according to 2019-2021 average
Definition: {Sum(Energy_Use_per_CLFT[Time=2019..2021]) / Sum(Sum(Energy_Use_per_CLFT[Time=2019..2021]), Customer) * is_customer}~
Average((Energy_Use_per_CLFT[Time=2019..2021]) / (Average(Sum(Energy_Use_per_CLFT[Time = 2019..2021], Customer)))) * is_customer
